---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — AgentLife"
  description="How AgentLife picks and ranks AI tools: one consistent rubric, refreshed monthly, and independent of who pays us."
>
  <main class="container">
    <section class="prose">
      <h1>How AgentLife works</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        AgentLife helps busy people find the AI tools that actually fit how they
        work — a few quick questions instead of a giant, unranked list.
      </p>

      <h2>How we rank tools</h2>
      <p>
        Every tool is scored the same way: how good it is at each task, and how
        much of the work it can take off your hands. We match that against what
        you tell us — your task, how hands-off you want to be, how much setup
        you'll tolerate, and whether you want free options — so results are
        ranked for <em>you</em>, not one-size-fits-all.
      </p>

      <h2>Kept current</h2>
      <p>
        The whole list is reviewed every month — an AI-assisted pass that we
        check by hand — so pricing and features stay accurate, discontinued
        tools drop off, and strong new ones get added. Each tool carries the
        date it was last reviewed.
      </p>

      <h2>How we stay honest</h2>
      <p>
        Some links are affiliate links: if you sign up through one, we may earn a
        commission at no extra cost to you. That never buys a better ranking. Fit
        comes first — an affiliate tool gets only a small nudge that can't
        override a genuinely better match, and we include excellent tools that
        have no affiliate program at all.
      </p>

      <h2>Suggest a tool</h2>
      <p>
        Think we've missed something great? We review every suggestion against
        the same criteria — neither being suggested nor running an affiliate
        program earns a spot. (A submission form is on its way.)
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 2rem auto 0;
  }
  .prose h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prose p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .lead {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
</style>
